<法規>
<法規性質>命令</法規性質>
<英文法規名稱>Fee-charging Standards for Application of Launch Vehicles Launch Permit</英文法規名稱>
<中文法規名稱>發射載具申請發射許可收費標準</中文法規名稱>
<法規網址>https://law.moj.gov.tw/Eng/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=H0160092</法規網址>
<最新英文異動日期>20241023</最新英文異動日期>
<廢止註記>
</廢止註記>
<附件 />
<沿革內容><![CDATA[1.Promulgated on October 23, 2024]]></沿革內容>
<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards are established in accordance with Article 10, Paragraph 1 of the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Applicants for the launch permit of launch vehicles in accordance with Article 11, Paragraph 1 of the Space Development Act shall pay a review fee. The review fee for each application is NT$23,000.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[Receipts shall be issued when fees are collected in accordance with these Standards.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[After the payment of the review fees stipulated in these Standards, no refunds or retention shall be requested for any reason,except in cases where the applicant is eligible for a refund under the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 5</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[If a launch permit is withdrawn or revoked after issuance in accordance with Article 15 of the Regulations for Launch Permit for Launch Vehicle and Handling of Space Accidents, the paid review fee will not be refunded.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 6</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[These Standards shall come into force as of the date of promulgation.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
